#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:3 templates/partials/navbar.html:31
msgid "Formation Professionnelle"
msgstr "Vocational Training"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:5
msgid "Cadre légal & dispositif national de la formation professionnelle"
msgstr "Legal framework & national vocational training system"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:12
msgid "La loi n° 2018/010 du 11 juillet 2018"
msgstr "Law n° 2018/010 of 11 July 2018"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:13
msgid ""
"La loi régissant la formation professionnelle au Cameroun fixe le cadre "
"juridique général ainsi que les orientations fondamentales de la formation "
"professionnelle. Le champ de la formation professionnelle couvre l'ensemble "
"des formations post-éducation de base, assurées par des structures publiques"
" ou par des structures privées agréées par l'État."
msgstr ""
"The law governing vocational training in Cameroon sets the general legal "
"framework and the fundamental guidelines for vocational training. The scope "
"of vocational training covers all post-basic-education training, provided by"
" public institutions or by private institutions approved by the State."

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:14
msgid ""
"L'État accorde à la formation professionnelle un caractère de priorité "
"nationale : il l'organise, la contrôle, et garantit l'égal accès à la "
"formation dans les deux langues officielles à toute personne remplissant les"
" conditions requises."
msgstr ""
"The State treats vocational training as a national priority: it organises "
"it, controls it, and guarantees equal access to training in both official "
"languages to anyone meeting the required conditions."

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:16
msgid "Les trois piliers de la formation professionnelle"
msgstr "The three pillars of vocational training"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:21
msgid "Formation initiale"
msgstr "Initial training"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:22
msgid ""
"Transmet les compétences, connaissances et savoir-faire indispensables à "
"l'exercice d'une activité professionnelle."
msgstr ""
"Provides the skills, knowledge and know-how essential to carrying out a "
"professional activity."

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:28
msgid "Formation continue"
msgstr "Continuing training"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:29
msgid ""
"Assure le recyclage ou le perfectionnement des professionnels, en structure "
"ou en entreprise."
msgstr ""
"Provides retraining or upskilling for professionals, either in an "
"institution or in a company."

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:35
msgid "Apprentissage"
msgstr "Apprenticeship"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:36
msgid ""
"Formation alternée de longue durée entre entreprise et centre, sanctionnée "
"par une qualification reconnue."
msgstr ""
"Long-term alternating training between a company and a centre, leading to a "
"recognised qualification."

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:41
msgid "Les structures publiques de formation professionnelle"
msgstr "Public vocational training institutions"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:42
msgid ""
"Le décret n° 2020/2592/PM du 9 juin 2020 fixe les modalités de création, "
"d'organisation et de fonctionnement des centres de formation professionnelle"
" et d'apprentissage. Six catégories de structures publiques composent le "
"réseau national :"
msgstr ""
"Decree n° 2020/2592/PM of 9 June 2020 sets the rules for the creation, "
"organisation and operation of vocational training and apprenticeship "
"centres. Six categories of public institutions make up the national network:"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:47
msgid "Centres de Formation Professionnelle d'Excellence"
msgstr "Centres of Excellence for Vocational Training"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:53
msgid "Centres Sectoriels de Formation Professionnelle"
msgstr "Sectoral Vocational Training Centres"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:59
msgid "Centres de Formation aux Métiers"
msgstr "Trade Training Centres"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:65
msgid "Centres d'Apprentissage Professionnel"
msgstr "Vocational Apprenticeship Centres"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:71
msgid "Centres Publics de Formation Professionnelle Rapide"
msgstr "Public Centres for Rapid Vocational Training"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:77
msgid "Sections Artisanales Rurales et Sections Ménagères"
msgstr "Rural Craft Sections and Home Economics Sections"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:81
msgid "Consulter l'annuaire des centres de formation"
msgstr "Browse the training centre directory"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:83
msgid "Ouvrir un centre privé de formation professionnelle"
msgstr "Opening a private vocational training centre"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:84
msgid ""
"Toute personne physique ou morale peut créer un centre privé de formation "
"professionnelle ou d'apprentissage, sous réserve de l'agrément préalable du "
"Ministre chargé de la formation professionnelle. La dénomination du centre "
"doit être précédée de « Centre de formation professionnelle », « Institut de"
" formation professionnelle » ou « Centre d'apprentissage ». L'agrément est "
"valable trois (3) ans, renouvelable."
msgstr ""
"Any individual or legal entity may create a private vocational training or "
"apprenticeship centre, subject to prior approval from the Minister in charge"
" of vocational training. The centre's name must be preceded by “Vocational "
"training centre”, “Vocational training institute” or “Apprenticeship "
"centre”. The approval is valid for three (3) years, renewable."

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:86
msgid "Formation des formateurs"
msgstr "Training the trainers"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:87
msgid ""
"Le Centre National de Formation des Formateurs et de Développement des "
"Programmes (CNFFDP), créé par décret présidentiel en 2023, a pour mission de"
" former les formateurs et de promouvoir l'ingénierie de la formation "
"professionnelle, en liaison avec la Direction de la Formation et de "
"l'Orientation Professionnelles du Ministère."
msgstr ""
"The National Centre for Trainer Training and Curriculum Development "
"(CNFFDP), established by presidential decree in 2023, is tasked with "
"training trainers and promoting vocational training engineering, in liaison "
"with the Ministry's Directorate of Training and Career Guidance."

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:92
msgid "Textes de référence"
msgstr "Reference texts"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:94
msgid ""
"Loi n° 2018/010 du 11 juillet 2018 régissant la formation professionnelle"
msgstr "Law n° 2018/010 of 11 July 2018 governing vocational training"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:95
msgid "Décret n° 2020/2592/PM du 9 juin 2020 relatif aux centres de formation"
msgstr "Decree n° 2020/2592/PM of 9 June 2020 on training centres"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:96
msgid ""
"Décret n° 2012/644 du 28 décembre 2012 portant organisation du Ministère"
msgstr ""
"Decree n° 2012/644 of 28 December 2012 on the organisation of the Ministry"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:98
msgid "Télécharger les textes"
msgstr "Download the texts"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:101
msgid "Validation des Acquis de l'Expérience"
msgstr "Validation of Prior Experience (VAE)"

#: templates/core/vocational_training.html:102
msgid ""
"La VAE est un droit reconnu à toute personne disposant d'aptitudes "
"professionnelles acquises dans la vie active, lui permettant d'obtenir une "
"certification correspondant à son expérience."
msgstr ""
"VAE is a right recognised for anyone with professional skills acquired "
"through work experience, allowing them to obtain a certification matching "
"their experience."

